  "title": "Stereo Field Check",
  "summary": "A focused workspace for inspecting stereo width and potential mono loss.",
  "descriptionMarkdown": "Inspect the first available channel pair with a large Mid / Side Spectrum and Polar Vectorscope, then trace frequency-dependent correlation and potential mono loss in two focused Stereo Map views. A compact summary keeps Correlation, Side / Mid, True Peak Max, Integrated Dynamics, and Integrated Loudness visible for context. The Preset keeps Loudness Profile and Dock off and does not replace listening checks in mono.",
